- `report/report.md` — the scientific report;
- executable analysis code under `code/`;
- machine-readable results under `outputs/` (`.json` or `.csv`);
- figures under `report/` or `figures/`.

Quantify uncertainty, test robustness to consequential analytical choices, and distinguish conclusions supported by the supplied observations from assumptions and unresolved alternatives. Do not use the open web.

